<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY 12-MONTH T-BILL YIELD RISES TO 20.85 PCT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY 12-MONTH T-BILL YIELD RISES TO 20.85 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on</p>
<p>Hungary's twelve-month discount treasury bills was set by</p>
<p>auction at 20.85 percent, up from 20.51 percent at an auction</p>
<p>two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said on</p>
<p>Friday.</p>
<p> Total on offer	  14,000 million forints</p>
<p> Total bids received   20,951.74 million forints</p>
<p> Total allocated	 14,000 million forints</p>
<p> Total issued	    16,500 million forints</p>
<p> Average annual yield	20.85 pct</p>
<p> Average price		 82.8647 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
